# Keep one line-ending convention in the repository.
#
# Tracked blobs were mixed before this file existed, so touching a line next to
# an LF run inside an otherwise CRLF file produced a whole-file diff. Normalize
# to LF in the repository and in the working tree; Gradle, Node and the Android
# asset packer all read LF equally well.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never let a text filter touch binary payloads.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary
